(6975546, 1052882, 65234, '<td valign="top">Awesome!!  I''m so glad someone did this.  I thought about it but didn''t have the props I would have needed.  So you get a bonus point for thinking along the same lines I did LOL.  If I look closely I can tell the artist is pasted in to the camera, but you got the concept across very well.</td>', 'Awesome!!  I''m so glad someone did this.  I thought about it but didn''t have the props I would have needed.  So you get a bonus point for thinking along the same lines I did LOL.  If I look closely I can tell the artist is pasted in to the camera, but you got the concept across very well.', '2013-02-08 11:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6975547, 1052894, 65234, '<td valign="top">Aw, he''s cute!  Bored, maybe, but cute.  Nice idea; well executed.</td>', 'Aw, he''s cute!  Bored, maybe, but cute.  Nice idea; well executed.', '2013-02-08 11:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
