(6975880, 1052941, 136989, '<td valign="top">Funny! Never would have thought of that. I like the low key space with the speakers and background.  It really high lights the performers.</td>', 'Funny! Never would have thought of that. I like the low key space with the speakers and background.  It really high lights the performers.', '2013-02-08 22:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
