(6975885, 1052398, 136989, '<td valign="top">Man wins ... At least for now.  We can still destroy the computer should we choose to do so.  Hmmm ... Second guessing myself on that now.  Heehee.  Very creative.</td>', 'Man wins ... At least for now.  We can still destroy the computer should we choose to do so.  Hmmm ... Second guessing myself on that now.  Heehee.  Very creative.', '2013-02-08 22:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
