(6976293, 1052950, 49954, '<td valign="top">Definitely meets the challenge and one of the best of the bunch, IMO.  A piece of technology (pencil sharpener) works with a kid running a chainsaw.  Very good idea and well done.  The only  gripe would be the shavings coming out the "hole" that we''re seeing through, but that''s minor.  Well done and I hope it scores very high. 8</td>', 'Definitely meets the challenge and one of the best of the bunch, IMO.  A piece of technology (pencil sharpener) works with a kid running a chainsaw.  Very good idea and well done.  The only  gripe would be the shavings coming out the "hole" that we''re seeing through, but that''s minor.  Well done and I hope it scores very high. 8', '2013-02-10 00:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
