(6976491, 1052905, 118154, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective image.</td>', 'Simple and effective image.', '2013-02-10 12:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6976540, 1052926, 12253, '<td valign="top">Now there''s a ribbon!</td>', 'Now there''s a ribbon!', '2013-02-10 13:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6976551, 1052926, 40391, '<td valign="top">Very clever and funny!</td>', 'Very clever and funny!', '2013-02-10 14:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6976586, 1052941, 49954, '<td valign="top">Ok, so this one actually met the challenge... showing what''s really going on behind a bit of technology, so good effort.  Unfortunately the behind the scenes part is less prevalent and dark, almost hard to see.</td>', 'Ok, so this one actually met the challenge... showing what''s really going on behind a bit of technology, so good effort.  Unfortunately the behind the scenes part is less prevalent and dark, almost hard to see.', '2013-02-10 16:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6976587, 1052946, 49954, '<td valign="top">Overall an ok effort, but nothing spectacular.  Perhaps if you''d shown through the back of the device a bunch of androids powering the unit, it would be cooler.  Right now it just looks like art or a screensaver on a tablet.  But it did meet the challenge, so good job there.</td>', 'Overall an ok effort, but nothing spectacular.  Perhaps if you''d shown through the back of the device a bunch of androids powering the unit, it would be cooler.  Right now it just looks like art or a screensaver on a tablet.  But it did meet the challenge, so good job there.', '2013-02-10 16:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6976588, 1052936, 49954, '<td valign="top">Ok, so this meets the challenge and is pretty well done.  I like that you flipped the monitor, but the black edge and words we should not be seeing (as if we were "inside" looking out.  Minor nit there.  Another is that the chain, rope and ladder should be on this side of the monitor, we should see them traverse the monitor frame.  Not major, but still detracts slightly.  Overall though, love the "burn" and a good effort.  6</td>', 'Ok, so this meets the challenge and is pretty well done.  I like that you flipped the monitor, but the black edge and words we should not be seeing (as if we were "inside" looking out.  Minor nit there.  Another is that the chain, rope and ladder should be on this side of the monitor, we should see them traverse the monitor frame.  Not major, but still detracts slightly.  Overall though, love the "burn" and a good effort.  6', '2013-02-10 16:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6976589, 1052907, 49954, '<td valign="top">Yep, this is what the theme of the challenge was about and sad that so few "got it".  But you did, so good job.  The resulting image, except for the little guys is a little flat however.  Not sure if it''s the base image you used or what, but they don''t look like one cohesive scene.  But good effort.  6</td>', 'Yep, this is what the theme of the challenge was about and sad that so few "got it".  But you did, so good job.  The resulting image, except for the little guys is a little flat however.  Not sure if it''s the base image you used or what, but they don''t look like one cohesive scene.  But good effort.  6', '2013-02-10 16:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6976590, 1052929, 49954, '<td valign="top">So I think I know who this photographer is and if I''m right, I''m sad because it''s nowhere near their best work.<br/> <br/>It does meet the challenge however, so that''s good.  Barely 50% if that many actually did.  The "technology" part (woman using the mixer -- and what an odd mixer it is too!) is more overpowering in the photo than the behind the scenes part.  The idea of slaves turning the gears is a very clever idea, however the castle walls as well as the fire tend to kill it.<br/> <br/>As Simon Cowell would have said, they were "indulgent" and make little sense to the effect.  They were overkill and show-offy.  Just having the guy whip the slaves to the turn the gears would have been enough.  I''d have like to have seen them a little more prominent too, but I can see that would be hard given the size of that beast of a mixer.<br/> <br/>In all a decent attempt, but falls way short.  6</td>', 'So I think I know who this photographer is and if I''m right, I''m sad because it''s nowhere near their best work. It does meet the challenge however, so that''s good.  Barely 50% if that many actually did.  The "technology" part (woman using the mixer -- and what an odd mixer it is too!) is more overpowering in the photo than the behind the scenes part.  The idea of slaves turning the gears is a very clever idea, however the castle walls as well as the fire tend to kill it. As Simon Cowell would have said, they were "indulgent" and make little sense to the effect.  They were overkill and show-offy.  Just having the guy whip the slaves to the turn the gears would have been enough.  I''d have like to have seen them a little more prominent too, but I can see that would be hard given the size of that beast of a mixer. In all a decent attempt, but falls way short.  6', '2013-02-10 16:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6976591, 1052894, 49954, '<td valign="top">Ok, so the challenge was met (not common in this one, so good job.  However, this feels a little rushed and looks like (I know it isn''t), but looks like a cutout from a magazine thrown into a watch and the photo taken.  The images don''t come together is a cohesive way.</td>', 'Ok, so the challenge was met (not common in this one, so good job.  However, this feels a little rushed and looks like (I know it isn''t), but looks like a cutout from a magazine thrown into a watch and the photo taken.  The images don''t come together is a cohesive way.', '2013-02-10 16:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6976592, 1052922, 49954, '<td valign="top">OK, so to me this doesn''t meet the challenge on a spirit basis, but does on a literal one... since we''re seeing how something actually works that we might not really see or understand.</td>', 'OK, so to me this doesn''t meet the challenge on a spirit basis, but does on a literal one... since we''re seeing how something actually works that we might not really see or understand.', '2013-02-10 16:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6976593, 1052887, 49954, '<td valign="top">First pass said this is just a shot of a harddrive which would DNMC the photo.  However a second pass seems to show some "blobs" that I guess are supposed to be "at work" in the machine.  Giving you the benefit of the doubt there, though they are very hard to see.</td>', 'First pass said this is just a shot of a harddrive which would DNMC the photo.  However a second pass seems to show some "blobs" that I guess are supposed to be "at work" in the machine.  Giving you the benefit of the doubt there, though they are very hard to see.', '2013-02-10 16:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6976594, 1052882, 49954, '<td valign="top">Very nice attempt, and met the theme.  A closer shot with more of the woman and just enough detail from the camera so that we know it''s a camera would have made it even stronger.</td>', 'Very nice attempt, and met the theme.  A closer shot with more of the woman and just enough detail from the camera so that we know it''s a camera would have made it even stronger.', '2013-02-10 16:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6976595, 1052948, 49954, '<td valign="top">I don''t get what I''m seeing here.  The first time through I was very confused as it looks like a blob on the battery.  Now with the title and looking a little harder, I assume it''s a piece of exercise equipment?  If so, it''s too small to be clear and it would have been more effective to show someone using the equipment to provide power to the battery.</td>', 'I don''t get what I''m seeing here.  The first time through I was very confused as it looks like a blob on the battery.  Now with the title and looking a little harder, I assume it''s a piece of exercise equipment?  If so, it''s too small to be clear and it would have been more effective to show someone using the equipment to provide power to the battery.', '2013-02-10 16:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6976596, 1052933, 49954, '<td valign="top">No idea what this is at all or how it fits the theme.  I see the Audi logo, but that''s about it.</td>', 'No idea what this is at all or how it fits the theme.  I see the Audi logo, but that''s about it.', '2013-02-10 16:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6976641, 1052929, 38921, '<td valign="top">Well done as usual, earns a 10 from me.  No wonder these things are so expensive.<br/> <br/>Nitpicking just a bit I think I would have like to see a bit of motion blur in the whisk.</td>', 'Well done as usual, earns a 10 from me.  No wonder these things are so expensive. Nitpicking just a bit I think I would have like to see a bit of motion blur in the whisk.', '2013-02-10 18:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6976661, 1052894, 124815, '<td valign="top">You took this challenge on a different level of quality, idea and execution.<br/> <br/>You got in one shot the fastidious Swiss character, the medieval times, the magician, the memory of the Flemish paintings, the modern times (allusion to a stock photography).<br/> <br/>A hard to beat image on all levels.</td>', 'You took this challenge on a different level of quality, idea and execution. You got in one shot the fastidious Swiss character, the medieval times, the magician, the memory of the Flemish paintings, the modern times (allusion to a stock photography). A hard to beat image on all levels.', '2013-02-10 19:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
