(6979734, 1052950, 114969, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Jeff, very impressive result, even more since it is a first try taking advantage of expert! Excellent concept, creative and fun as I like them. Oh, and a very funny side story with your shrunk son :-) Thanks for the laugh.</td>', 'Congratulations Jeff, very impressive result, even more since it is a first try taking advantage of expert! Excellent concept, creative and fun as I like them. Oh, and a very funny side story with your shrunk son :-) Thanks for the laugh.', '2013-02-15 09:38:59.000000', NULL, 0),
