(6980287, 1052929, 41337, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by MNet:</b></div><hr/><i> Congrats, it was 10 from me as always. Very clever with the double meaning of slave :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>There''s actually a triple meaning here if you look deeper and consider the full body of work.</td>', 'Originally posted by MNet: Congrats, it was 10 from me as always. Very clever with the double meaning of slave :)   There''s actually a triple meaning here if you look deeper and consider the full body of work.', '2013-02-16 14:52:04.000000', NULL, 0),
